{"p": "/message/metadata/search_result_groups", "o": "append", "v": [{"type": "search_result_group", "domain": "www.the-sun.com", "entries": [{"type": "search_result", "url": "https://www.the-sun.com/news/16318001/skinny-tiger-struggles-walk-sparking-zoo-outrage-china/", "title": "Heartbreaking moment skinny tiger struggles to walk up slope as it staggers across zoo sparking outrage over conditions", "snippet": "A disturbing video taken at Chuandong Ecological Zoo in Longchang, Sichuan Province, China, has sparked public outrage after showing a visibly emaciated tiger struggling to walk up a small slope in its enclosure. The tiger, with protruding ribs and hip bones, appeared weak and staggered, nearly collapsing from fatigue. Witnesses were shocked and recorded the footage, which went viral on Douyin, spurring widespread concern over the animal’s condition.

Local authorities, including Xiangshi Town Government and the Longchang Culture and Tourism Bureau, launched an investigation. Officials clarified that the tiger is a 16- to 18-year-old Siberian tiger—quite elderly for the species—and had been rescued years earlier. Recently recovering from illness, the tiger was reportedly fed regularly but had a reduced appetite. Zoo staff said this was its first outing outdoors post-recovery to get sun and exercise.

Although zoo officials denied abuse or starvation, criticism mounted over the animal’s care. Authorities stated they would continue monitoring the tiger's condition and consider moving it to a better facility if necessary to ensure adequate care.", "ref_id": {"turn_index": 0, "ref_type": "news", "ref_index": 19}, "pub_date": 1778001700.0, "attribution": "www.the-sun.com"}]}]}
